{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56233","headline":"龙丘山（题拟） · 贯休","name":"龙丘山（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几朵碧芙蕖，王维图未图。\n层层皆有瀑，一一合吾居。\n雨歇如争出，严霜不到枯。\n世犹多事在，爲尔久踌躇。\n（见康熙十五年刊杨廷望纂《衢州府志》卷三。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}